    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35553" root="قرمد" body-key="q">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُقَرْمَدٌ</span></b> : see the verb, of which it is the pass.
part. n. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  A building <i>constructed with baked
bricks</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">آجُرّ</span> [or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قِرْمِيد</span>]) or (in the K, and) <i>with
stones:</i> (S, L, Msb, K:) or <i>lofty,</i> or <i>high.</i> (K.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  A building <i>thickly plastered.</i> (TA, art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كلس</span>.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <i>Narrow:</i> (TA:) or <i>made narrow.</i> (L.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b5- 
A garment <i>smeared</i> with saffron and perfume:
(L, Msb:) or <i>smeared with the like of saffron.</i>
(K. [in the CK, for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِشِبْهِ الزعفرانِ</span> is put <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يُشْبِهُ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الزعفرانَ</span>.])

